DESCRIPTION:Replace with a steady aerobic run of 35–40 min at 6:30–7:00
 /km — no intervals this week\; reintroduce structured run stimulus gentl
 y before escalating to interval work\n\nReason: Only one run has been logg
 ed in the past 4 weeks and it was performed at a very high HR (169 bpm)\; 
 jumping straight into 6x800m intervals risks injury and excessive fatigue 
 given the deconditioning and poor sleep trend.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
