DESCRIPTION:Cap at 10–11 km at 6:45–7:15/km (approximately 75–80 min)
  — prioritise completing it feeling comfortable over hitting distance ta
 rgets\n\nReason: With minimal run base logged\, low sleep scores persistin
 g\, and a 5K swim race the following weekend\, a conservative long run pro
 tects against injury and ensures adequate recovery heading into race week.
 \n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
