DESCRIPTION:Reduce to 4x800m @ 5:10–5:25/km with 90 sec jog recovery — 
 slightly reduced volume and pace to build interval tolerance progressively
  ahead of the marathon block\n\nReason: This is only the second structured
  run week after a long gap\; gradually introducing interval work at a mana
 geable dose reduces injury risk while still delivering the run stimulus ne
 eded for the marathon 120 days away.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
