DESCRIPTION:Shorten to 45–60 min easy spin at Z1–low Z2 (<160W)\, treat
 ing this as a leg-opener before Sunday's 5K open water swim race\n\nReason
 : The day before a priority swim race\, a full 4-hour long ride would leav
 e residual fatigue in the legs and shoulders — a short activation spin p
 reserves freshness for race day.\n\nAI coaching 2026-10-10
END:VEVENT
